                                                "sense_id": "6521658c-cd66-3341-b8b8-977199d06b74",
                                                "text": "Rather than climb into a bottomless off-width crack, we aided an 80-foot A2 to A3 crack to the top of a pedestal. By very tenuous face climbing, we gained entry to the crack, which we followed to a tree beneath the big chimney."
                                            }
