                                                "sense_id": "29a14bc0-1eab-356e-b9ab-4bb48beab37d",
                                                "text": "By simple promotion and remotion, assisted by some flexure and extension, the distal spines of each would reach and scratch the substratum and, on remotion, sweep coarse particles posteriorly and dorsally."
